# NOTE: apps/api's own e2e test directory only (backend e2e fixtures — its
# tsconfig.build.json already excludes "test" from the compile scope, so
# leaving this dir out of the Docker context just trims build-context size).
# Do NOT broaden this to a bare `test`/`**/test` pattern: apps/web/src/test/
# holds shared test *infrastructure* (setup-tests.ts, importing
# @testing-library/jest-dom for its global matcher type augmentation) that
# apps/web's tsconfig.app.json does NOT exclude from `tsc -b` — excluding
# that directory broke the web Docker build (tsc couldn't find the jest-dom
# matcher types used by *.test.tsx files still in its compile scope).
apps/api/test
**/*.e2e-spec.ts
minio-data
postgres-data
--full-page
